ance before payment in the next payroll run.\n[result-screen/1: kept 4 of 5 passages (1,865 of 2,284 chars); omitted HB-33 §4; unscreened: fetch(['HB-33 §4']) or /task/workspace/search-results/SR-004.txt]\n<<end search-result SR-004>>\n"
